          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Consider the following function:</p><pre><code>void <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">quiz</span>(int n)\n{if (n &gt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)\n{<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">quiz</span>(n / <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">quiz</span>(n / <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);\n}\nSystem<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.out</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.print</span>(&quot;* &quot;);\n}</code></pre><p>How many asterisks are printed by the function call quiz(5)?</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Xét hàm sau:</p><pre><code>void <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">quiz</span>(int n)\n{if (n &gt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>)\n{<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">quiz</span>(n / <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">quiz</span>(n / <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>);\n}\nSystem<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.out</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.print</span>(&quot;* &quot;);\n}</code></pre><p>Có bao nhiêu dấu sao được in ra bởi lời gọi hàm quiz(5)?</p></div>",
